OL,3,GNEWSAJeffrey Donaldson expected to be
OL,4,Asentenced next month
OL,5,
OL,6,FConvicted child sex offender Jeffrey
OL,7,FDonaldson is expected to be sentenced
OL,8,Fin October, a court has heard.
OL,10,FThe former DUP leader was convicted in
OL,11,FJune of 18 counts of sex abuse,
OL,12,Fincluding one count of rape, against
OL,13,Ftwo women when they were children.
OL,15,FThe 63-year-old, who is currently in
OL,16,FMaghaberry Prison as he awaits his
OL,17,Fsentencing, was not present at the
OL,18,Freview hearing at Newry Crown Court.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
