OL,3,GNEWSAJeffrey Donaldson expected to be
OL,4,Asentenced next month
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Paul Ramsey said he had received
OL,7,Ftwo victim impact reports, from the two
OL,8,Fcomplainants in the case. He said a
OL,9,Fnumber of other reports, including
OL,10,Fmedical, were yet to be provided.
